WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.853
At a bridge project handover,

00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:07.558
two engineers are checking two versions of the same drawing.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:14.697
I updated the drawing yesterday. I moved the pier to its new position.

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:21.846
Thanks, Maya. The copy on my desk still shows the old pier.

00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:25.096
Which version is on the server?

00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:29.295
I have just uploaded the revised drawing.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.844
Open revision B in the shared folder.

00:00:33.494 --> 00:00:36.919
Yesterday tells us when the change happened.

00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:41.322
Have just uploaded tells us what is ready now.

00:00:41.972 --> 00:00:45.141
Which file should the team use now?
